+28|/**
+29| * For each job that has a FINISH event, emit the number of task SUBMIT events
+30| * in its longest "stage". A stage is a maximal run of SUBMIT events (for a
+31| * given job) such that consecutive SUBMITs are at most {@code sesssize}
+32| * seconds apart in event time; a stage ends after {@code sesssize} seconds
+33| * of inactivity (no further SUBMITs for that job).
+34| *
+35| * Output format: one line per job, "(jobId,count)".
+36| */
+37|public class LongestSessionPerJob extends AppBase {
+38|
+39|    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
+40|
